# d45 exact-head CI audit

Run 36349836006 at `d45c3610a586fab926a98a8656bb337792a38b6c`. The validation job passed, but the native six-profile matrix failed because x64 ASan Debug Menu fails `TestLargeMenuPaintsOnlyVisibleRowsWithCachedOffsets`: `End-to-visible latency remains bounded`. MenuAccessibility passes in that profile. The failed job exits before external consumer and gallery. This is not a six-profile qualification pass. Formatting CI is separate.

