Seven retained performance receipts (two in x64 Release, one in each other profile) are clean-source, exact-head, native-architecture, 5 rounds × 40 frames for both clean and dirty scenarios, with one shared benchmark fingerprint. ARM64 Menu has nine interactive-desktop skips per profile; they are explicit and do not assert focus routing. The x64 profiles have no skips. All six retained external-consumer receipts exit 0, including the ARM64 ASan annotations-disabled run. Five successful profiles have eight gallery files each and a completed generation log; failed x64 ASan has neither consumer nor gallery. Both ASan probe receipts report detection. Extracted artifact file hashes and every skip reason are in `audit.json`; GitHub artifact IDs/digests and job conclusions are in `run-artifacts.json` and `run-status.json`.
